Z","label":{"name":"device specific issue","color":"fbca04"},"performed_via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/comments/210492163","html_url":"https://github.com/google/ExoPlayer/issues/1443#issuecomment-210492163","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/1443","id":210492163,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDIxMDQ5MjE2Mw==","user":{"login":"DavidMihola","id":594955,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5NDk1NQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/594955?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavidMihola","html_url":"https://github.com/DavidMihola","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavidMihola/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavidMihola/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavidMihola/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavidMihola/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavidMihola/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavidMihola/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavidMihola/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavidMihola/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavidMihola/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2016-04-15T14:55:31Z","updated_at":"2016-04-15T14:55:31Z","body":"Thanks for the reply and sorry for not providing a full report right away!\n\n**A description of the issue**\nIn short, on some devices ExoPlayer does not send STATE_ENDED when a local MP4 video is finished.\n\n**Steps describing how the issue can be reproduced**\n- Download sample video from this URL: http://www.sample-videos.com/video/mp4/720/big_buck_bunny_720p_10mb.mp4\n- Copy downloaded video to device\n- Open latest version of ExoPlayer Demo App (1.5.7) in Android Studio\n- Add the following item to `Samples.MISC`:\n\n```\nnew Sample(\n    \"Local Sample Video\",\n    \"file:/storage/sdcard1/Pictures/officetv/SampleVideo_1280x720_10mb.mp4\",\n    Util.TYPE_OTHER\n)\n```\n\nOf course, change the file path to point to the video location on the device.\n- Start ExoPlayer Demo and play \"Local Sample Video\"\n- Expected: After about 1 minute the Stream should stop, playbackState should be \"ended\" and progress should stop increasing\n- Actual: After about 1 minute the Stream stop, but playbackState stays \"ready\" and progress keeps increasing indefinitely.\n\n**The device(s) and version(s) of Android on which the issue can be reproduced**\n- The device in question is small Android box. Unfortunately, I have yet to determine an exact device name. In Android Studio it shows up as  \"Unknown SoftwinerEvb\" (probably that should be \"Softwinner\"). `Build.MANUFACTURER` is \"unknown\", `Build.MODEL` is \"SoftwinerEvb\". The box itself has no label that would give any clues.\n- The device is running Android 4.2.2.\n- The problem appeared in 100% of my trials on this device.\n- The problem did not appear on any other tested device at all.\n\n**ADB Bugreport**: https://gist.github.com/DavidMihola/59e832ac78ce2ccd5f79e8948c21e3cf\n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/comments/210492163/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"DavidMihola","id":594955,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5NDk1NQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/594955?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavidMihola","html_url":"https://github.com/DavidMihola","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavidMihola/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavidMihola/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavidMihola/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavidMihola/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavidMihola/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavidMihola/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavidMihola/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavidMihola/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavidMihola/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/comments/210502619","html_url":"https://github.com/google/ExoPlayer/issues/1443#issuecomment-210502619","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/1443","id":210502619,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDIxMDUwMjYxOQ==","user":{"login":"ojw28","id":7881572,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4ODE1NzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7881572?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28","html_url":"https://github.com/ojw28","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2016-04-15T15:20:48Z","updated_at":"2016-04-15T15:20:48Z","body":"Thanks! You'll probably find that modifying MediaCodecTrackRenderer's codecNeedsEosPropagationWorkaround method to look as follows resolves the issue:\n\n```\nprivate static boolean codecNeedsEosPropagationWorkaround(String name) {\n return Util.SDK_INT <= 17 && (\"OMX.rk.video_decoder.avc\".equals(name)\n    || \"OMX.allwinner.video.decoder.avc\".equals(name));\n}\n```\n\nPlease give that a try and let us know what you find!\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/comments/210502619/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"ojw28","id":7881572,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4ODE1NzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7881572?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28","html_url":"https://github.com/ojw28","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/comments/211417930","html_url":"https://github.com/google/ExoPlayer/issues/1443#issuecomment-211417930","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/1443","id":211417930,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDIxMTQxNzkzMA==","user":{"login":"DavidMihola","id":594955,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5NDk1NQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/594955?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavidMihola","html_url":"https://github.com/DavidMihola","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavidMihola/followers","following_ur